# MinerU environment for CUDA 12.x drivers (e.g. RunPod driver 570 = CUDA 12.8).
# vLLM's PyPI wheel is a CUDA 13 build; vLLM publishes a +cu129 build on GitHub
# releases, which runs on any CUDA 12.x driver (minor-version compatibility).
